  "limits": [
    "No SS/FF closure asserted. Macro capture follows macro-agent proposed2cycle pin-local capture; macro constraints and live source wrapper must validate it.",
    "Track counts are channel capacity inequalities, not detailed-route evidence. SRAM input/output channels, compute pins and power grid require top-level integration.",
    "Area is a positive budget proxy, not measured cell area. Mutable protection/clock tree may grow area.",
    "Absolute power unavailable pending read energy and routed network activity/capacitance. Idle-bank clock gating mandatory; larger capacity does not imply all bank captures toggle every cycle.",
    "Latency counted here ends at packed response pins; add existing sm_v PIO,bulk-copy,issue,compute,output latency without double counting FIFO storage. Existing retained bulk-copy SRAM must be counted as well unless replaced by validated cheaper adapter."
  ]
